{"id":"7f5043d4200f56d1","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-truth-expansion.md","title":"固定基础结构的唯一经典真理扩张","display":"df-truth-expansion — 固定基础结构的唯一经典真理扩张","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-truth-expansion","aliases":["91-df-truth-expansion","91-df-expansion"],"display":"df-truth-expansion — 固定基础结构的唯一经典真理扩张","depends_on":["[[91-df-structure]]","[[91-df-language-with-truth]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-truth-expansion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-truth-expansion</span><span>91-df-expansion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-truth-expansion — 固定基础结构的唯一经典真理扩张"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c8e718c83a9cc331\" href=\"?note=c8e718c83a9cc331\" title=\"91-df-structure\">91-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"97fe560478d37064\" href=\"?note=97fe560478d37064\" title=\"91-df-language-with-truth\">91-df-language-with-truth</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M_0=(D,I_0)\">\\(\\mathfrak M_0=(D,I_0)\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_0\">\\(\\mathcal L_0\\)</span> 结构；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T=\\mathcal L_0\\cup\\{T\\}\">\\(\\mathcal L_T=\\mathcal L_0\\cup\\{T\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 为新的关系符号，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq D\">\\(A\\subseteq D\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_0\\cup\\{(T,A)\\}\">\\(I_0\\cup\\{(T,A)\\}\\)</span> 为扩张解释函数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M_0[A]\">\\(\\mathfrak M_0[A]\\)</span> 为所定义结构。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}expansion}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathfrak M_0[A]\\coloneqq(D,I_0\\cup\\{(T,A)\\}),\n\\qquad\\mathfrak M_0[A]\\upharpoonright\\mathcal L_0=\\mathfrak M_0,\n\\qquad T^{\\mathfrak M_0[A]}=A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}expansion}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathfrak M_0[A]\\coloneqq(D,I_0\\cup\\{(T,A)\\}),\n\\qquad\\mathfrak M_0[A]\\upharpoonright\\mathcal L_0=\\mathfrak M_0,\n\\qquad T^{\\mathfrak M_0[A]}=A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>新增符号不在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_0\">\\(I_0\\)</span> 的域中，故扩张是函数且唯一。对任意闭项 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M_0[A]\\models_{\\mathrm{CL}}T(t)\">\\(\\mathfrak M_0[A]\\models_{\\mathrm{CL}}T(t)\\)</span> 当且仅当该项在基础结构中的值属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>。\n这是经典语言扩张，不必满足任何真理公理。它也不是部分三值模型 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathbb N,A,B)\">\\((\\mathbb N,A,B)\\)</span>。标准一致固定点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的经典闭包给出 KF 模型；任意非标准基础结构上的信息闭包还须另验证完整归纳，不能直接推广。</p>\n<p>来源：§8.2 对结构扩张的约定；Theorem 15.15 的经典闭包。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c8e718c83a9cc331","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-language-with-truth","status":"resolved","id":"97fe560478d37064","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-language-with-truth]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak M_0=(D,I_0)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_T=\\mathcal L_0\\cup\\{T\\}","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq D","display":false},{"tex":"I_0\\cup\\{(T,A)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M_0[A]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}expansion}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathfrak M_0[A]\\coloneqq(D,I_0\\cup\\{(T,A)\\}),\n\\qquad\\mathfrak M_0[A]\\upharpoonright\\mathcal L_0=\\mathfrak M_0,\n\\qquad T^{\\mathfrak M_0[A]}=A.","display":true},{"tex":"I_0","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M_0[A]\\models_{\\mathrm{CL}}T(t)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"(\\mathbb N,A,B)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":1418,"backlinks":[{"id":"ce2e952933d30cc2","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f276735320c6ad44","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0815358d5b1d8115","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c38d15bb3c121301","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-97","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-expansion]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-97","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-adequacy-conditions.md]]\n[[91-df-arithmetical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-df-capture-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-classical-extension.md]]\n[[91-df-coded-syntax.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-axioms.md]]\n[[91-df-compositional-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conjunction-axiom.md]]\n[[91-df-conservative-truth.md]]\n[[91-df-conservativi